1
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:48,000
You could call Oren Little 'charming' — except no one does.

2
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:30,000
And So It Goes is a comedy, drama, romance film directed by Rob Reiner.

3
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:12,000
Nobody likes self-centered realtor Oren Little, and he prefers it that way.

4
00:18:48,000 --> 00:18:54,000
He's deliberately mean to anyone who crosses his path and wants
nothing more than to sell one final house and retire.

5
00:23:30,000 --> 00:23:36,000
His life turns upside-down when his estranged son drops
off a granddaughter he never knew existed.

6
00:28:12,000 --> 00:28:18,000
Suddenly left in charge of her and with no idea how to take care of a child, he pawns the girl
off on his neighbor, Leah -- but he eventually learns how to open his heart.

7
00:32:54,000 --> 00:33:00,000
Oren Little, played by Michael Douglas.

8
00:37:36,000 --> 00:37:42,000
Leah, played by Diane Keaton.

9
00:42:18,000 --> 00:42:24,000
Sarah, played by Sterling Jerins.

10
00:47:00,000 --> 00:47:06,000
Selena, played by Paloma Guzmán.

11
00:51:42,000 --> 00:51:48,000
Claire, played by Frances Sternhagen.

12
00:56:24,000 --> 00:56:30,000
Club Owner, played by Frankie Valli.

13
01:01:06,000 --> 01:01:12,000
And So It Goes is a 2014 American comedy drama film directed
by Rob Reiner and written by Mark Andrus.

14
01:05:48,000 --> 01:05:54,000
The film, which stars Michael Douglas, Diane Keaton and
Sterling Jerins, was released on July 25, 2014.

15
01:10:30,000 --> 01:10:36,000
It received mostly negative reviews from critics, and
performed modestly at the box office.

16
01:15:12,000 --> 01:15:18,000
The film was the second collaboration between Reiner and
Douglas, after The American President (1995).

17
01:19:54,000 --> 01:20:00,000
This film was also Frances Sternhagen's final feature film
role before her death on November 27, 2023.

18
01:24:36,000 --> 01:24:42,000
The film explores themes of grandparent grandchild relationship,
neighbor, wealthy, falling in love, real estate agent.

19
01:29:18,000 --> 01:29:24,000
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
